    "detailed_description": "<strong>MonoRace</strong> is a cheerful monobike racing where you can explore tracks and get points by performing tricks. Try the game in VR and PC versions with unique controls. <br><br>Monobikes is an electric, self-balancing unicycles, and you need to lean your body to control them. We have transferred this control mechanism to the game. <br>In VR game lean forward to accelerate, lean back to brake and lean left or right to turn.<br>In PC version move a mouse to control your unicycle.<br><br>Experience the game:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There will be a lot of tracks available and there will be several race paths on each of them. You can ride the main path or you can take a short cut.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get benefits by collecting bonuses.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Perform mortal tricks to get points and survive to the end without fail.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Be the quickest, or all your tricks point will be lost.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lead in Leagues: complete exercises and get points to upgrade the unicycle and unlock new tracks.</li></ul> <br>Multiplayer mode: it's much more interesting to compete with other players and you will have this opportunity.<br><br>In training mode, you can try our unique control system and practice tricks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860870/extras/253549f55c495c29aa5665f18a794745.avif?t=1749813463\" width=600 height=151 /></span>",
